      "sender_class": "supplier_planning",
      "channel": "portal",
      "text": "Supplier C portal update: Plant 5 will have 10% extra capacity available from 14 September to 11 October, thanks to an added weekend shift. Contact Lena in planning with any questions."
    },
    {
      "id": "pilot-015-m0002",
      "period": 37,
      "sender": "Supplier B planning",
      "sender_class": "supplier_planning",
      "channel": "email",
      "text": "Hello,\n\nOur ref. MN-3391. Plant 4 will run 20% below normal capacity in weeks 39 and 40 because of planned maintenance on the main kiln. Please call me on ext. 418 if you need to discuss.\n\nRegards,\nKarin Holm, Supplier B Planning"
    },
    {
      "id": "pilot-015-m0003",
      "period": 38,
      "sender": "Supplier B planning",
      "sender_class": "supplier_planning",
      "channel": "portal",
      "text": "Correction to our notice of last week (ref. MN-3391): the capacity cut at Plant 4 for weeks 39 and 40 will be 15%, not 20% as we said. This replaces the earlier notice. Karin, Supplier B Planning"
    },
    {
      "id": "pilot-015-m0004",
      "period": 38,
      "sender": "Sales ops",
      "sender_class": "sales",
      "channel": "email",
      "text": "Hi all,\n\nBecause one of our larger retail customers is running a one-week in-store promotion, and their buyer confirmed the extra quantities on yesterday's call, customer orders for SKU-03 are expected to be 10% higher in week 39 only.\n\nThanks,\nRaj, Sales Ops"
    },
    {
